<title>AUSTRIA: Buba's Issing calls for fiscal sanctions in EMU.</title>
<headline>Buba's Issing calls for fiscal sanctions in EMU.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank council member Otmar Issing on Friday called for automatic sanctions for nations that failed to maintain fiscal discipline within a single European currency.</p>
<p>&quot;Sanctions should not come after a long-winded examination process which could be drawn out over several years, but should if at all possible kick in automatically if the rules of the game are not adhered to,&quot; Issing said, according to the text of a speech to be delivered to economists in Vienna.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
